OL,3,GNEWSABreak-in at flats left empty after
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA block of flats left empty after a
OL,7,Ffire in Weymouth has been broken into.
OL,9,FThe fire in Keel House on Dorchester
OL,10,FRoad broke out in a top-floor flat on
OL,11,F20 September shortly before 00:40 BST.
OL,12,FThe flames spread to the building's
OL,13,Froof space, and residents from all 32
OL,14,Fflats were forced to leave.
OL,16,FDorset Police said entry was believed
OL,17,Fto have been gained to the building on
OL,18,FMonday shortly after midday. The force
OL,19,Fsaid a glass door was reported damaged,
OL,20,Fbut it had not been confirmed if
OL,21,Fanything had been taken. An
OL,22,Finvestigation is ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
