OL,3,GNEWSABreak-in at flats left empty after
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the fire, a man and a woman
OL,7,Fwere arrested on suspicion of arson
OL,8,Fwith intent to endanger life. The were
OL,9,Fboth released on police bail.
